!}

We do not endorse him and we do not obstruct him. Asked whether Gowin belongs
in the opposition, we say that the opposition is not a club with a membership
committee and that his votes count the same as anybody's.

PSL and Hołownia can now be photographed with him without it becoming a
left-wing attack line, which is the actual favour and which they notice.

