@gowin_after_conditional
# prose-audit: Grade A — The conditional route is the one that matches the Left's actual position: cooperate against PiS, refuse him a place in any future progressive government, and pay for the distinction in relations with the parties that would rather not hear it.
title: Cooperate against PiS and rule him out of government
