We will vote with him against the government, co-sign what we agree with, and
say in advance and in public that there is no version of a future government
that contains both Lewica and the man who carried the judicial laws. Both
things, in the same sentence, every time.

It irritates PSL, who would prefer the question deferred until after an
election. It is also the only position we will not have to explain away later.

