= The chair

[? if sroka_leads_porozumienie = 1: **Magdalena Sroka** takes the chair. She was never a minister in a PiS government, spent the postal-election spring on the side of the people who wanted it stopped, and can therefore walk into a room with PSL and Polska 2050 without the first twenty minutes being about the Constitutional Tribunal. Gowin stays as a deputy and as the person who will be asked about the judicial laws for the rest of his career. The party has finally separated its politics from its founder's biography, which is the only thing that was ever going to make it negotiable.?]
[? if sroka_leads_porozumienie = 0: Gowin stays. The party is doing well enough, or he is welcome enough, that nobody can make the argument that he is the problem — and so Porozumienie goes into the election year represented by the man who was deputy prime minister when the Supreme Court was reorganised. Every conversation about a joint list will begin there.?]

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

